Package: swbrd-ice-dissolve
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Evan Brass <brassevan@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: swbrd-common (>= @COMPAT@), nftables, systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), libc6 (>= 2.38), libgcc-s1
Homepage: https://github.com/evan-brass/swbrd
Description: Stateless ICE interception for swbrd
 Answers STUN Binding Requests whose USERNAME starts "dissolve:" straight off a
 TUN interface, without ever binding a socket.  Ships the nftables rule that
 marks those packets and the policy route that sends them to the interface.
 .
 Built for one private host and not fit for redistribution; see
 /usr/share/doc/swbrd-ice-dissolve/copyright.
